Day 11 — Step 3A: Create network_events

Open:

database/database_manager.py

You already have create_security_events_table() there.

Add this function below it:

def create_network_events_table():

    conn = sqlite3.connect(DB_NAME)
    cursor = conn.cursor()

    cursor.execute("""
        CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS network_events (
            id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
            timestamp TEXT,
            process_name TEXT,
            pid INTEGER,
            protocol TEXT,
            status TEXT,
            source_ip TEXT,
            source_port INTEGER,
            destination_ip TEXT,
            destination_port INTEGER
        )
    """)

    conn.commit()
    conn.close()

